1
00:00:00,124 --> 00:00:03,334
(Penny:)Okay, I don't need your attitude.
Just hold him there a little longer.

2
00:00:03,502 --> 00:00:07,342
(Howard:)I've done my best, but he wants to go home
and I don't know how to stop him.

3
00:00:07,506 --> 00:00:08,506
Okay, how about this?

4
00:00:08,674 --> 00:00:10,884
Keep him longer,
when you get to the party...

5
00:00:11,052 --> 00:00:13,642
(Penny:)...I'll point out which of my friends
are easy.

6
00:00:22,813 --> 00:00:25,193
(Howard:)Don't toy with me, woman.

7
00:00:26,525 --> 00:00:28,525
I got a former fat girl
with no self-esteem.

8
00:00:28,694 --> 00:00:30,944
(Penny:)A girl who punishes her father
by sleeping around.

9
00:00:31,113 --> 00:00:34,863
(Penny:)An alcoholic who's two tequila shots
away from letting you wear her like a hat.

10
00:00:37,036 --> 00:00:38,456
(Howard:)Thy will be done.

11
00:00:48,714 --> 00:00:51,214
(Howard:)I'm doing this for you, little buddy.

12
00:00:57,056 --> 00:01:00,096
(Sheldon:)Okay, we don't have that in stock...

